  NodeID: MothersCatFledDragon
  SpeakerName: Narrator
  DialogueText: '"You enter your mother''s home. Handing her the cat, you tell her
    that you succeeded at finding the cat. You didn''t have to deal with the dragon.
    Later in the evening as the cat had already wandered outside, you hear a crashing
    noise. You see flame consume your mother''s home."'
  Choices:
  - ChoiceText: '[The cycle repeats.]'
